This package vendors static builds of SPIRV-Reflect, part of the KhronosGroup
SPIRV-Reflect project, licensed under the Apache License 2.0:

- linux/libspvreflect.a, built with gcc.
- windows/spvreflect.lib, cross-built with x86_64-w64-mingw32-gcc and
  x86_64-w64-mingw32-ar from the same source tag, with -DNDEBUG.

Both are built from tag vulkan-sdk-1.4.341.0; the commands are in README.md.
The full license text is in LICENSE.spirv-reflect.apache-2.0.
See https://github.com/KhronosGroup/SPIRV-Reflect.

The C3 binding itself (spvreflect.c3) is MIT-licensed — see LICENSE.
